{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37581","headline":"南康郡牧陆肱郎中辟许棠先辈爲郡从事因有寄赠 · 郑谷","name":"南康郡牧陆肱郎中辟许棠先辈爲郡从事因有寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"末路思前侣，犹爲恋故巢。\n江山多胜境，宾主是贫交。\n饮舫闲依苇，琴堂雅结茅。\n夜清僧伴宿，水月在松梢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}